@file 4:
@file 5: # Set design attributes
@@file 6: set_db design_process_node 65
##  Process: 65            (User Set)               
##     Node: (not set)                           

##  Check design process and node:  
##  Design tech node is not set.

Applying the recommended capacitance filtering threshold values for 65nm process node: total_c_th=0, relative_c_th=1 and coupling_c_th=0.1.
	These values will be used by all post-route extraction engines, including TQuantus, IQuantus and Quantus QRC extraction.
	Capacitance filtering mode(extract_rc_cap_filter_mode option of the set_db) is 'relative_and_coupling' for all engines.
	The accuracy mode for post_route extract_rc_effort_level low extraction will be set to 'high'.
	Default value for EffortLevel(extract_rc_effort_level option of the set_db) in post_route extraction mode is 'medium'.
@file 7:
@@file 8: set_db design_top_routing_layer M7
@@file 9: set_db design_bottom_routing_layer M2 
@@file 10: set_db design_flow_effort standard ;
@file 10: # {express standard extreme}
@@file 11: set_db design_power_effort low ;
@file 11: # {none low high}
@@file 12: set_db place_global_place_io_pins true
@file 13: # Set timing attributes
@@file 14: set_db timing_analysis_cppr           both
@@file 15: set_db timing_analysis_type           ocv
